#senate.mtb
noecho
note This macro will perform random sampling
note of U.S. Senators, keeping track of the numbers of
note Democrats and Republicans in each sample and
note of the distribution of years of service in the sample.
note
note The user is to specify the size of the sample to be chosen.
note
note
note
note ***** Do you want to proceed? *****
yesno k1
exec 'senators\senate1.mtb' k1
echo
end

